<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/00GS">Corollary <span data-tag="00GS">1.2.1.21</span>.</a> The connected component functor </p>
<div class="equation">
  \[ \pi _0: \operatorname{Set_{\Delta }}\rightarrow \operatorname{Set}\quad \quad S_{} \mapsto \pi _0( S_{} ) \]
</div>
<p> of Remark <a data-tag="00GN" href="/tag/00GN">1.2.1.17</a> is left adjoint to the constant simplicial set functor </p>
<div class="equation">
  \[ \operatorname{Set}\rightarrow \operatorname{Set_{\Delta }}\quad \quad I \mapsto \underline{I}_{} \]
</div>
<p> of Construction <a data-tag="00FS" href="/tag/00FS">1.1.5.2</a>. More precisely, the construction $S_{} \mapsto (u: S_{} \rightarrow \underline{ \pi _0( S_{})}_{})$ is the unit of an adjunction. </p>
